<section id="examples" class="tab-content">

<h2 class="section-title">
Solved Examples
</h2>


<div class="example">

<div class="example-title">
Example 1 — Calculate Force
</div>

<p>
A body of mass 5 kg accelerates at 4 m/s².
Find the force acting on it.
</p>

<div class="formula">
F = ma
</div>

<div class="formula">
F = 5 × 4 = 20 N
</div>

<div class="answer">
Answer: <strong>20 N</strong>
</div>

</div>


<div class="example">

<div class="example-title">
Example 2 — Find Acceleration
</div>

<p>
A force of 60 N acts on a mass of 12 kg.
Find acceleration.
</p>

<div class="formula">
a = F/m
</div>

<div class="formula">
a = 60/12 = 5 m/s²
</div>

<div class="answer">
Answer: <strong>5 m/s²</strong>
</div>

